#############################################
# Root / Course Website Ignore File
# Reorganized: 2025-09-21
# Rationale: Group by category, tighten overly broad rules, explicitly keep AGENTS.md
#############################################

########## OS & Editor ##########
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/**
.idea/
.history/

########## Python Bytecode & Caches ##########
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
pip-wheel-metadata/

########## Environments ##########
.env
.env.*
venv/
.venv/
env/
.venv

########## Build / Packaging ##########
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.whl

########## Quarto & Render Artifacts ##########
_site/
_output*/
_freeze/**
site_libs/**
**/.jupyter_cache/
.quarto
/_*.local
**/execute-results/**
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/**
**/*.quarto_ipynb  # intermediary produced when rendering notebooks to qmd

########## Legacy / Unneeded Book Build ##########
archive/

########## Archives & Large Bundles ##########
**/archive/**
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.gz
*.bz2

########## Node / JS ##########
node_modules/

########## Data (raw / large) ##########
# Keep structure but ignore raw bulk data; adjust if you want to version a subset.
data/**
!data/README.md

########## Demos ##########
